          <head>ΜΗΔΕΙΑ</head>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0348_medeia" xml:id="tlg0348-fr1">
            <head>1</head>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="tlg0348-fr1-l1" xml:lang="grc"> .  . τὸ θρέψαι δ’ ἐν βροτοῖσι πολλάκις</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="tlg0348-fr1-l2" xml:lang="grc">πλείω πορίζει φίλτρα τοῦ φῦσαι τέκνα.</l>
            </lg>
            <p>Stob. Flor. 78 , 3 : βιότου ἐκ Μηδείας. ‘τὸ — τέκνα’ . lemma
frustra in suspicionem vocatum esse docuit Meineke Monatsb. d.
Preuss. Akad. d. Wiss. 1850 p. 257 . poetae et fabulae nomine
omisso eundem locum affert Clemens Alex. Paed. I p. 127 .</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
